name    mod-procedural-dungeon: a death on map 760 (zone 5100) ends alive at the entrance, never at a graveyard
# Server-side test bot run (mod-fl-testbots), T1. Zone 5100 has no graveyard_zone row; the core's fallback for a
# release there is a graveyard far away. The interim (operator 2026-10-16: "sollen vorerst einfach am anfang
# respawnen"): the module resurrects a dead player on its next 1 Hz tick at the entrance (or the last cleared boss
# hall), no release on map 760 reaches the core's graveyard search, and a player who logs out dead is resurrected
# so the home teleport carries them out alive. A fresh layout has no cleared boss hall: back at the entrance.
# The director generates a fixed layout for its account (seed 434578084, theme 1: entrance -1166.67 -300.00 52.00)
# and both are placed there in GM mode - GM mode skips the DLL gate (no FLStream.dll on a bot session; the server
# side builds the map all the same) - then leave GM mode. Needs EvictDisconnected to spare bot sessions.
#   1. die and release at once: the release is held back, the tick brings the bot back alive, unsickened, at the
#      entrance.
#   2. die, no release: the same, by the tick alone.
#   3. die and log out at once (a client's drop): the bot logs in again at its homebind (Tbwara: Dalaran, map 571),
#      not at a graveyard. The harness revives a bot at login, so the place is the proof, not the life state.
timeout 150s

bot a warrior
group party

place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
as gm .pdungeon v2 gen 434578084 1
expect output has "pdungeon v2: seed 434578084 theme 1"
do gm gm on
do a gm on
place 760 -1166.67 -300.00 52.00
require gm map 760
require a map 760
do gm gm off
do a gm off
wait 3s
require a map 760
mark start

log 1 - die and release at once
do a die
expect a dead
do a release
expect a map 760
waitfor a alive timeout 5s
expect a map 760
expect a at start 15
expect a noaura 15007

log 2 - die, no release
do a die
expect a dead
waitfor a alive timeout 5s
expect a map 760
expect a at start 15

log 3 - die and log out at once
do a die
do a relog
waitfor a exists timeout 30s
expect a map 571
expect a near 5718.6 682.7 645.8 40

cleanup
place 727 13288.5 11776.2 -31.5
